-9026"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Neuroradiology Division, Department of Radiology, Newark Beth Israel Medical Center, Newark, NJ, USA. gagan32092@gmail.com."}]}}, {"fullName": "Manjila S", "lastName": "Manjila", "firstName": "Sunil", "initials": "S", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Neurosurgery, Ayer Neuroscience Institute, The Hospital of Central Connecticut, New Britain, CT, USA."}]}}, {"fullName": "Sakla N", "lastName": "Sakla", "firstName": "Nicole", "initials": "N", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Neuroradiology Division, Department of Radiology, Newark Beth Israel Medical Center, Newark, NJ, USA."}]}}, {"fullName": "True A", "lastName": "True", "firstName": "Alan", "initials": "A", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Neuroradiology Division, Department of Radiology, Newark Beth Israel Medical Center, Newark, NJ, USA."}]}}, {"fullName": "Wardeh AH", "lastName": "Wardeh", "firstName": "Amr H", "initials": "AH", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-8322-1244"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Neuroradiology Division, Department of Radiology, Newark Beth Israel Medical Center, Newark, NJ, USA."}]}}, {"fullName": "Beig N", "lastName": "Beig", "firstName": "Niha", "initials": "N", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Biomedical Engineering, Case Western Reserve University, Cleveland, OH, USA."}]}}, {"fullName": "Vaysberg A", "lastName": "Vaysberg", "firstName": "Anatoliy", "initials": "A", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Neuroradiology Division, Department of Radiology, Newark Beth Israel Medical Center, Newark, NJ, USA."}]}}, {"fullName": "Matthews J", "lastName": "Matthews", "firstName": "John", "initials": "J", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Neuroradiology Division, Department of Radiology, Newark Beth Israel Medical Center, Newark, NJ, USA."}]}}, {"fullName": "Prasanna P", "lastName": "Prasanna", "firstName": "Prateek", "initials": "P", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Department of Biomedical Informatics, Stony Brook University, Stony Brook, NY, USA."}]}}, {"fullName": "Spektor V", "lastName": "Spektor", "firstName": "Vadim", "initials": "V", "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Neuroradiology Division, Department of Radiology, Columbia University Medical Center, New York City, NY, USA."}]}}]}, "authorIdList": {"authorId": [{"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-8322-1244"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0003-4291-9026"}]}, "dataLinksTagsList": {"dataLinkstag": ["altmetrics", "supporting_data"]}, "journalInfo": {"issue": "5", "volume": "125", "journalIssueId": 3224836, "dateOfPublication": "2021 Aug", "monthOfPublication": 8, "yearOfPublication": 2021, "journal": {"medlineAbbreviation": "Br J Cancer", "title": "British journal of cancer", "essn": "1532-1827", "issn": "0007-0920", "nlmid": "0370635", "isoabbreviation": "Br J Cancer"}, "printPublicationDate": "2021-08-01"}, "pubYear": "2021", "pageInfo": "641-657", "abstractText": "The natural history and treatment landscape of primary brain tumours are complicated by the varied tumour behaviour of primary or secondary gliomas (high-grade transformation of low-grade lesions), as well as the dilemmas with identification of radiation necrosis, tumour progression, and pseudoprogression on MRI. Radiomics and radiogenomics promise to offer precise diagnosis, predict prognosis, and assess tumour response to modern chemotherapy/immunotherapy and radiation therapy. This is achieved by a triumvirate of morphological, textural, and functional signatures, derived from a high-throughput extraction of quantitative voxel-level MR image metrics. However, the lack of standardisation of acquisition parameters and inconsistent methodology between working groups have made validations unreliable, hence multi-centre studies involving heterogenous study populations are warranted. We elucidate novel radiomic and radiogenomic workflow concepts and state-of-the-art descriptors in sub-visual MR image processing, with relevant literature on applications of such machine learning techniques in glioma management.", "affiliation": "Neuroradiology Division, Department of Radiology, Newark Beth Israel Medical Center, Newark, NJ, USA. gagan32092@gmail.com.", "publicationStatus": "ppublish", "language": "eng", "pubModel": "Print-Electronic", "pubTypeList": {"pubType": ["review-article", "Review", "Journal Article"]}, "meshHeadingList": {"meshHeading": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Humans"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Glioma", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "abbreviation": "DG", "qualifierName": "diagnostic imaging"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "GE", "qualifierName": "genetics"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "PA", "qualifierName": "pathology"}]}}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Brain Neoplasms", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "abbreviation": "DG", "qualifierName": "diagnostic imaging"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "GE", "qualifierName": "genetics"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "abbreviation": "PA", "qualifierName": "pathology"}]}}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Radiographic Image Interpretation, Computer-Assisted", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "abbreviation": "MT", "qualifierName": "methods"}]}}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Magnetic Resonance Imaging"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Prognosis"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Genomics", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "abbreviation": "MT", "qualifierN